      "width": 1640,
      "height": 75,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "text": "Example economic key: org-demo / run-7 / increase / sandbox / account-A / transaction-123 / settlement\nDifferent webhook event IDs may describe that same economic effect. Enforce one posting for this key.\nEnforce logical uniqueness with indexed reads + writes in one mutation; an index alone is not a unique constraint.",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
