      "originalText": "Example economic key: org-demo / run-7 / increase / sandbox / account-A / transaction-123 / settlement\nDifferent webhook event IDs may describe that same economic effect. Enforce one posting for this key.\nEnforce logical uniqueness with indexed reads + writes in one mutation; an index alone is not a unique constraint.",
